criteria:
Inclusion Criteria:

* Age \>18 years
* Class I or II obesity assessed at T0 with comorbid risk factors (EOSS \> or equal to 2) for which an SIO appropriateness form with a score \> or equal to 20 has been completed
* Patients who agree to begin treatment with a GLP-1 or GLP-1/GIP analog
* Fit for physical exercise
* Willingness to participate in the 12-week program
* Understanding of the Italian language and ability to complete the questionnaires
* Understanding of the research objectives and ability to provide informed consent.

Exclusion Criteria:

* Age \< 18 years;
* Non-Italian education, illiteracy, or relapse into illiteracy;
* Low motivation/interest or refusal to undergo assessment;
* Absence of comorbidities (EOSS \< or equal to 1)
* Major psychiatric disorders, substance abuse;
* Obesity secondary to genetic and endocrinological disorders (e.g., hypercortisolism, acromegaly, overt hypothyroidism);
* Functional limitations that prevent participation in physical therapy sessions;
* Concurrent participation in other trials that could potentially interfere with the outcomes of this study.
